elle. Lorsqu'ils sont placés côte à côte, il est impossible de dire lequel est le véritable. La raison pour laquelle le rotin naturel est plus cher est qu'il faut plus de temps pour le coller artificiellement.\",\"style\":{\"paddingLeft\":16,\"paddingRight\":16,\"paddingTop\":10,\"paddingBottom\":10,\"fontSize\":14,\"fontWeight\":\"regular\",\"align\":\"left\",\"color\":\"#666666\",\"fontFamily\":\"OpenSans\",\"backgroundColor\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}},{\"type\":\"media\",\"data\":{\"mediaId\":5000497936135,\"previewImage\":\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S9ce1904d81ec42ddb3a2157f7151161b9.jpg\",\"src\":\"https://video.aliexpress-media.com/play/u/2686683083/v/5000497936135\",\"style\":{\"width\":720,\"height\":720}}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"data\":{\"url\":\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S6ba0387510e74cf1be0dc08c04736ab34.jpg\",\"style\":{\"width\":800,\"height\":800,\"paddingBottom\":10}}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"data\":{\"url\":\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S9b5a96f39f8e42dfa4ccf0577ac7cbebx.jpg\",\"style\":{\"width\":790,\"height\":834,\"paddingBottom\":10}}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"data\":{\"url\":\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S7c193eb8f7bc49fea56f776fb5ade943G.jpg\",\"style\":{\"width\":790,\"height\":560,\"paddingBottom\":10}}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"data\":{\"url\":\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S4d43491e003f4124b83a7c88e6c6a8355.jpg\",\"style\":{\"width\":790,\"height\":1098,\"paddingBottom\":10}}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"data\":{\"url\":\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sea1865f77c754a88903eed5facb8b27ch.jpg\",\"style\":{\"width\":790,\"height\":1084,\"paddingBottom\":10}}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"data\":{\"url\":\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S893ef3799f6e4ebba406e265322d07a5N.jpg\",\"style\":{\"width\":790,\"height\":1014,\"paddingBottom\":10}}},{\"type\":\"image\",\"data\":{\"url\":\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sa9499de8041942ba84d14382498bb79d9.jpg\",\"style\":{\"width\":7